<title>USA: Phonetel Technologies sets $125 mln in junk debt.</title>
<headline>Phonetel Technologies sets $125 mln in junk debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from Phonetel Technologies Inc was priced on Friday via lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER: PHONETEL TECHNOLOGIES INC</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	 COUPON 12 PCT     MATURITY 12/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 6/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 12 PCT	PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD 560 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
</text>
